  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Justice 4 Swedish authorities preparation - Justice support through 4 Swedish authorities</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Justice 4 Swedish authorities preparation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Insatsen syftar till att unders&#xf6;ka m&#xf6;jligheterna f&#xf6;r att utforma ett l&#xe5;ngsiktigt
samarbetsprojekt mellan svenska r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe5;rdande myndigheter och deras albanska motsvarigheter inom ungdomsbrottslighet och/eller k&#xf6;nsrelaterat v&#xe5;ld. Projektets utformning kommer att &#xe5;terspegla en ansats i tv&#xe5; faser, genom att f&#xf6;rst genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie (feasibility study) och sedan m&#xf6;jligen framtagande av ett samarbetsprojekt med syfte att arbeta med hela r&#xe4;ttskedjan.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The intervention aims to explore opportunities for designing a long-term cooperation project between the Swedish agencies of the justice sector and their Albanian counterparts in the field of Juvenile Justice and /or Gender violence. The project design will reflect a two phases approach of conducting first a feasibility study and then eventually the full-scale design of the cooperation project with the view of addressing the whole chain of justice.</narrative>
  </description>
